<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>About Nano Labs Ltd</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Nano Labs Ltd is a leading fabless integrated circuit (&ldquo;IC&rdquo;)
design company and product solution provider in China. Nano Labs is committed to the development of high throughput computing (&ldquo;HTC&rdquo;)
chips, high performance computing (&ldquo;HPC&rdquo;) chips, distributed computing and storage solutions, smart network interface cards
(&ldquo;NICs&rdquo;) vision computing chips and distributed rendering. Nano Labs has built a comprehensive flow processing unit (&ldquo;FPU&rdquo;)
architecture which offers solution that integrates the features of both HTC and HPC. Nano Lab&rsquo;s Cuckoo series are one of the first
near-memory HTC chips available in the market*. For more information, please visit the Company&rsquo;s website at: ir.nano.cn.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">*</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">According to an industry report prepared by Frost &amp; Sullivan.</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

